---
import MainGridLayout from "@/layouts/MainGridLayout.astro";

interface Props {
	lang?: string;
}

const { lang = Astro.url.pathname.startsWith("/en") ? "en" : "zh_CN" } =
	Astro.props;
const isEn = lang === "en";

const title = isEn ? "Spin Shove · The Quantum Push" : "量子推手 · SPIN SHOVE";
const description = isEn
	? "Spin Shove: An interactive exploration of the OIST spin-mechanics milestone (Science Advances 2026). Electron spins in a levitated NV-diamond assembly pushed a 128-milligram centimeter-scale object across 100 nanometers — leaping 8 to 9 orders of magnitude toward macroscopic quantum superposition."
	: "量子推手 · SPIN SHOVE：探索冲绳科学技术大学院大学（OIST）2026 年自旋力学里程碑实验。激光极化金刚石 NV 色心电子自旋，首次推动 128 毫克厘米级悬浮石墨板位移 100 纳米，跨越 8 至 9 个数量级，迈向宏观量子叠加态。";
---

<MainGridLayout title={title} description={description} lang={lang}>
	<div class="flex w-full rounded-(--radius-large) overflow-hidden relative min-h-32 mb-8">
		<div class="z-10 px-4 sm:px-8 py-8 relative w-full rounded-(--radius-large) overflow-hidden bg-[#070b12] text-slate-100 border border-slate-800/80 shadow-2xl selection:bg-emerald-500/30 selection:text-emerald-200">
			<!-- Background Ambient Laboratory Glow -->
			<div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-20 bg-[radial-gradient(#10b981_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:28px_28px] overflow-hidden"></div>
			<div class="absolute -top-32 -left-32 w-80 h-80 bg-emerald-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
			<div class="absolute top-1/3 -right-32 w-96 h-96 bg-cyan-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
			<div class="absolute bottom-10 left-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-blue-700/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

			<!-- 1. HERO HEADER SECTION -->
			<section class="relative z-10 mb-10 pb-8 border-b border-slate-800/80">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono font-semibold tracking-wide">
							<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
							<span>OIST · SCIENCE ADVANCES 2026 · NAYAK ET AL.</span>
						</div>
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-400 text-xs font-mono">
							<span>⚛</span>
							<span>DIAMAGNETIC LEVITATION · SPIN MECHANICS</span>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">
						<span class="lang-zh">2026-10-09 发表于《科学进展》（Science Advances）</span>
						<span class="lang-en">Published 2026-10-09 in Science Advances</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-white mb-2 font-sans">
					<span class="lang-zh">量子推手 · SPIN SHOVE</span>
					<span class="lang-en">Spin Shove · The Quantum Push</span>
				</h1>

				<p class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-emerald-400 mb-4 tracking-wide font-mono">
					<span class="lang-zh">电子自旋第一次推动了厘米级的物体——128 毫克，100 纳米。</span>
					<span class="lang-en">Electron spins just pushed a centimeter-scale object — 128 milligrams, 100 nanometers.</span>
				</p>

				<div class="space-y-3 max-w-3xl text-slate-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
					<p>
						<span class="lang-zh">
							在日本冲绳科学技术大学院大学（OIST），物理学家将一块厘米尺寸的石墨薄板抗磁悬浮于由交错磁铁构成的棋盘阵列之上。石墨板下方悬吊着一颗 3 毫米大小的金刚石，其内部蕴含着可通过激光精准操控的氮-空位（NV）色心电子自旋。研究团队使用 532 纳米绿光激光极化自旋，并施加外部推力磁场将自旋极化转换为机械推力，让重达 128 毫克（相当于数颗大米）的悬浮组件移动了约 100 纳米——相当于人类头发直径的千分之一。
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							At the Okinawa Institute of Science and Technology (OIST), physicists levitated a centimeter-sized graphite plate above a checkerboard array of alternating magnets via diamagnetic levitation. Suspended beneath the plate was a 3-millimeter diamond containing nitrogen-vacancy (NV) centers — atomic defects whose electron spins are controllable with optical laser light. By polarizing these spins with a green laser and applying an external magnetic field, they converted spin alignment into classical movement: a 128-milligram assembly (the mass of several grains of rice) was shoved roughly 100 nanometers — about one thousandth of a human hair's width.
						</span>
					</p>
					<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400">
						<span class="lang-zh">
							这是人类历史上首次在比以往自旋力学实验重 8 至 9 个数量级的宏观物体上观测到量子自旋力引发的经典机械运动。位移本身属于牛顿经典力学范畴，但启动位移的源动力来自纯粹的量子效应。该突破为未来让宏观宏大物体进入量子叠加态、乃至检验引力本身是否遵循量子规律开辟了全新的道路。
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							This marks the first observation of a classical mechanical response to a quantum force on an object eight to nine orders of magnitude more massive than previous spin-mechanics experiments. While the resulting motion is classical, a quantum force triggered it. This leap lays the groundwork for placing macroscopic objects into quantum superposition, probing whether gravity itself obeys quantum rules.
						</span>
					</p>
				</div>

				<!-- Key Stats Row -->
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 mt-6">
					<div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400 font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase">
							<span class="lang-zh">悬浮组件质量</span>
							<span class="lang-en">ASSEMBLY MASS</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-mono font-black text-white mt-1">128 mg</div>
						<div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">≈ 3 粒大米 · 厘米级石墨板 + 3mm 金刚石</span>
							<span class="lang-en">≈ 3 grains of rice · cm graphite + 3mm diamond</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400 font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase">
							<span class="lang-zh">经典机械位移</span>
							<span class="lang-en">CLASSICAL PUSH</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-mono font-black text-emerald-300 mt-1">100 nm</div>
						<div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">头发直径千分之一（100 µm 的 1/1000）</span>
							<span class="lang-en">1/1000th human hair width (100 µm scale)</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-rose-400 font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase">
							<span class="lang-zh">质量跨越尺度</span>
							<span class="lang-en">MASS LEAP</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-mono font-black text-rose-300 mt-1">×10⁸–10⁹</div>
						<div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">相比此前微观/纳克级自旋力学纪录</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Beyond prior micro/nanogram spin-mechanics</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- 2. THE LAB BENCH (MAIN INTERACTIVE SVG SCENE) -->
			<section class="relative z-10 mb-12 pb-10 border-b border-slate-800/80">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-6">
					<div>
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold mb-1">
							<span>LAB BENCH 01</span>
							<span>·</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">实时自旋力学实验台</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Real-Time Spin-Mechanics Bench</span>
						</div>
						<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
							<span class="lang-zh">实验台与纳米显微镜 · The Lab Bench</span>
							<span class="lang-en">The Lab Bench · Interactive Nanoscale Push</span>
						</h2>
					</div>
					<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 max-w-md">
						<span class="lang-zh">拖动推力磁铁，操作激光极化或微波反转电子自旋，然后启动量子推力观测悬浮物体的 100 纳米位移。</span>
						<span class="lang-en">Position the push magnet, polarize or flip spins with laser/microwave pulses, and trigger the quantum force to shove the levitated plate.</span>
					</p>
				</div>

				<!-- Main Interactive SVG Bench Container -->
				<div class="relative w-full rounded-2xl bg-[#03060b] border border-slate-800/90 p-4 sm:p-6 shadow-inner overflow-hidden mb-6">
					<!-- Top bench status bar -->
					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 pb-3 mb-4 border-b border-slate-800/60 text-xs font-mono">
						<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
							<span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-ping"></span>
							<span class="text-slate-300 font-semibold">
								<span class="lang-zh">真空室状态：抗磁悬浮就绪（室温 298 K）</span>
								<span class="lang-en">CHAMBER: Diamagnetic Levitation Active (298 K)</span>
							</span>
						</div>
						<div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-slate-400">
							<span id="bench-state-label" class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">STATE: IDLE (DECOHERED)</span>
							<span id="bench-magnet-dist-label">MAGNET DISTANCE: 6.0 mm</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- SVG Side-View Scene -->
					<div class="relative w-full flex justify-center items-center py-2">
						<svg id="lab-bench-svg" viewBox="0 0 800 360" class="w-full h-auto select-none max-w-4xl" style="filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.6));">
							<defs>
								<!-- Laser Beam Gradient -->
								<linearGradient id="laserBeamGrad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="0%">
									<stop offset="0%" stop-color="#22ff88" stop-opacity="0.9" />
									<stop offset="60%" stop-color="#6ee7b7" stop-opacity="0.95" />
									<stop offset="100%" stop-color="#ffffff" stop-opacity="1" />
								</linearGradient>
								<!-- Diamond Facet Gradient -->
								<linearGradient id="diamondFacet" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
									<stop offset="0%" stop-color="#e0f2fe" />
									<stop offset="50%" stop-color="#38bdf8" />
									<stop offset="100%" stop-color="#0284c7" />
								</linearGradient>
								<!-- Graphite Plate Gradient -->
								<linearGradient id="graphiteSurface" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="0%" y2="100%">
									<stop offset="0%" stop-color="#475569" />
									<stop offset="50%" stop-color="#334155" />
									<stop offset="100%" stop-color="#1e293b" />
								</linearGradient>
								<!-- Laser Beam Filter Glow -->
								<filter id="laserGlowEffect" x="-20%" y="-40%" width="140%" height="180%">
									<feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="4" result="blur" />
									<feComposite in="SourceGraphic" in2="blur" operator="over" />
								</filter>
								<filter id="diamondGlowEffect" x="-30%" y="-30%" width="160%" height="160%">
									<feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="6" result="blur" />
									<feComposite in="SourceGraphic" in2="blur" operator="over" />
								</filter>
							</defs>

							<!-- Bench Floor / Table Frame -->
							<rect x="20" y="325" width="760" height="15" rx="3" fill="#0f172a" stroke="#1e293b" stroke-width="1.5" />
							<line x1="20" y1="330" x2="780" y2="330" stroke="#334155" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="8,4" opacity="0.3" />

							<!-- Magnet Checkerboard Base Strip (Alternating N/S Neodymium Magnets) -->
							<g id="checkerboard-array" transform="translate(160, 275)">
								<!-- Array Base Track -->
								<rect x="-10" y="38" width="450" height="8" rx="2" fill="#1e293b" />
								
								<!-- Magnet 1: N (Red) -->
								<rect x="0" y="0" width="70" height="38" rx="3" fill="#ef4444" stroke="#dc2626" stroke-width="1.5" />
								<text x="27" y="25" fill="#ffffff" font-family="monospace" font-size="18" font-weight="bold">N</text>

								<!-- Magnet 2: S (Blue) -->
								<rect x="72" y="0" width="70" height="38" rx="3" fill="#3b82f6" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="1.5" />
								<text x="99" y="25" fill="#ffffff" font-family="monospace" font-size="18" font-weight="bold">S</text>

								<!-- Magnet 3: N (Red) -->
								<rect x="144" y="0" width="70" height="38" rx="3" fill="#ef4444" stroke="#dc2626" stroke-width="1.5" />
								<text x="171" y="25" fill="#ffffff" font-family="monospace" font-size="18" font-weight="bold">N</text>

								<!-- Magnet 4: S (Blue) -->
								<rect x="216" y="0" width="70" height="38" rx="3" fill="#3b82f6" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="1.5" />
								<text x="243" y="25" fill="#ffffff" font-family="monospace" font-size="18" font-weight="bold">S</text>

								<!-- Magnet 5: N (Red) -->
								<rect x="288" y="0" width="70" height="38" rx="3" fill="#ef4444" stroke="#dc2626" stroke-width="1.5" />
								<text x="315" y="25" fill="#ffffff" font-family="monospace" font-size="18" font-weight="bold">N</text>

								<!-- Magnet 6: S (Blue) -->
								<rect x="360" y="0" width="70" height="38" rx="3" fill="#3b82f6" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="1.5" />
								<text x="387" y="25" fill="#ffffff" font-family="monospace" font-size="18" font-weight="bold">S</text>

								<!-- Checkerboard Label -->
								<text x="120" y="58" fill="#64748b" font-family="monospace" font-size="11" letter-spacing="1">
									MAGNET CHECKERBOARD (DIAMAGNETIC LEVITATION TRAP)
								</text>
							</g>

							<!-- Levitation Field Lines (Diamagnetic Repulsion Arcs) -->
							<g opacity="0.3" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" stroke-dasharray="4,4">
								<path d="M 195 275 Q 230 230 267 275" />
								<path d="M 267 275 Q 303 230 339 275" />
								<path d="M 339 275 Q 375 230 411 275" />
								<path d="M 411 275 Q 447 230 483 275" />
								<path d="M 483 275 Q 519 230 555 275" />
							</g>

							<!-- Laser Emitter Module (Left side) -->
							<g id="laser-emitter-box" transform="translate(40, 205)">
								<rect x="0" y="0" width="65" height="50" rx="5" fill="#0f172a" stroke="#334155" stroke-width="1.5" />
								<rect x="58" y="16" width="12" height="18" rx="2" fill="#334155" />
								<circle cx="28" cy="25" r="10" fill="#020617" />
								<circle id="laser-lens-dot" cx="28" cy="25" r="5" fill="#10b981" />
								<text x="-4" y="-8" fill="#10b981" font-family="monospace" font-size="10" font-weight="bold">532nm LASER</text>
							</g>

							<!-- Laser Beam (Active during initialization pulse) -->
							<g id="bench-laser-beam" opacity="0" style="transition: opacity 0.3s ease;">
								<line x1="110" y1="230" x2="375" y2="230" stroke="url(#laserBeamGrad)" stroke-width="6" filter="url(#laserGlowEffect)" />
								<line x1="110" y1="230" x2="375" y2="230" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="2" />
								<!-- Beam impact spot -->
								<circle cx="375" cy="230" r="10" fill="#22ff88" opacity="0.7" filter="url(#laserGlowEffect)" />
								<circle cx="375" cy="230" r="3" fill="#ffffff" />
							</g>

							<!-- Microwave Antenna Loop (Behind assembly, emits pi-pulse) -->
							<g id="microwave-emitter" transform="translate(375, 120)">
								<path d="M -25 0 C -25 40 25 40 25 0" fill="none" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="3,3" opacity="0.6" />
								<text x="-32" y="-6" fill="#94a3b8" font-family="monospace" font-size="9">MW COIL</text>
							</g>

							<!-- Microwave Pulse Ring (Flashes during flip) -->
							<g id="mw-pulse-ring" opacity="0" transform="translate(375, 230)" style="transition: opacity 0.25s ease;">
								<circle cx="0" cy="0" r="28" fill="none" stroke="#f59e0b" stroke-width="3" opacity="0.8" />
								<circle cx="0" cy="0" r="42" fill="none" stroke="#f59e0b" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4,4" opacity="0.5" />
							</g>

							<!-- LEVITATING GRAPHITE & DIAMOND ASSEMBLY (Moved via JavaScript on shove) -->
							<g id="bench-levitating-assembly" transform="translate(0, 0)" style="transition: transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1);">
								<!-- Gentle floating CSS container -->
								<g id="bench-floating-bob">
									<!-- Graphite Plate (260px wide, ~1cm representation, 16px thick) -->
									<g transform="translate(245, 165)">
										<!-- Shadow on magnets below -->
										<ellipse cx="130" cy="95" rx="110" ry="8" fill="#000000" opacity="0.4" />

										<!-- Graphite Body -->
										<rect x="0" y="0" width="260" height="16" rx="3" fill="url(#graphiteSurface)" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="1.5" />
										<!-- Top reflection streak -->
										<line x1="6" y1="3" x2="254" y2="3" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.5" />
										
										<!-- Plate Label -->
										<text x="45" y="-10" fill="#cbd5e1" font-family="monospace" font-size="11" font-weight="bold">
											GRAPHITE PLATE · 128 mg (LEV-GAP ≈ 1.2 mm)
										</text>

										<!-- Diamond Stem / Rigid Link -->
										<rect x="127" y="16" width="6" height="30" fill="#334155" stroke="#475569" stroke-width="0.5" />
										
										<!-- 3mm NV Diamond (Faceted Polygon with 4 red NV dots) -->
										<g id="bench-diamond-facet" transform="translate(130, 65)">
											<!-- Diamond body -->
											<polygon points="0,-18 22,-6 16,18 0,26 -16,18 -22,-6" fill="url(#diamondFacet)" stroke="#e0f2fe" stroke-width="1.5" filter="url(#diamondGlowEffect)" />
											<polygon points="0,-18 0,26 16,18" fill="#bae6fd" opacity="0.5" />
											<polygon points="0,-18 0,26 -16,18" fill="#0284c7" opacity="0.4" />
											<polygon points="-22,-6 0,-18 22,-6 0,-4" fill="#ffffff" opacity="0.75" />

											<!-- 4 Glowing NV Centers (Red defect atoms) -->
											<g id="diamond-nv-dots">
												<circle cx="-6" cy="-2" r="2.5" fill="#ff1744" />
												<circle cx="-6" cy="-2" r="6" fill="#ff1744" opacity="0.4" />
												<circle cx="7" cy="4" r="2.5" fill="#ff1744" />
												<circle cx="7" cy="4" r="6" fill="#ff1744" opacity="0.4" />
												<circle cx="-2" cy="12" r="2.2" fill="#ff1744" />
												<circle cx="4" cy="-8" r="2" fill="#ff1744" />
											</g>

											<text x="30" y="8" fill="#38bdf8" font-family="monospace" font-size="10" font-weight="bold">
												3mm NV DIAMOND
											</text>
										</g>
									</g>
								</g>
							</g>

							<!-- PUSH MAGNET MODULE (Draggable along horizontal rail on the right) -->
							<g id="bench-push-magnet-group" transform="translate(640, 195)" style="cursor: grab;">
								<!-- Track rail indicator -->
								<line x1="-120" y1="75" x2="40" y2="75" stroke="#475569" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
								<line x1="-120" y1="75" x2="40" y2="75" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4,4" />

								<!-- Magnet Housing & S-Pole -->
								<rect x="-35" y="0" width="70" height="52" rx="4" fill="#1d4ed8" stroke="#60a5fa" stroke-width="2" />
								<rect x="-30" y="5" width="60" height="42" rx="2" fill="#2563eb" />
								<text x="-9" y="32" fill="#ffffff" font-family="monospace" font-size="22" font-weight="bold">S</text>
								<text x="-38" y="-10" fill="#60a5fa" font-family="monospace" font-size="10" font-weight="bold">PUSH MAGNET</text>
								
								<!-- Pole Gradient Field Lines -->
								<g opacity="0.5" stroke="#60a5fa" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none">
									<path d="M -35 15 C -55 20 -55 32 -35 37" />
									<path d="M -35 5 C -70 12 -70 40 -35 47" />
								</g>

								<!-- Drag hint handle -->
								<g transform="translate(0, 58)">
									<rect x="-24" y="0" width="48" height="14" rx="7" fill="#0f172a" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="1" />
									<text x="-16" y="10" fill="#94a3b8" font-family="monospace" font-size="9">◀ DRAG ▶</text>
								</g>
							</g>

							<!-- Motion Indicator Arrow (Shown during push) -->
							<g id="motion-indicator-arrow" opacity="0" transform="translate(375, 140)" style="transition: opacity 0.3s ease;">
								<line x1="0" y1="0" x2="-25" y2="0" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
								<polygon points="-25,0 -16,-5 -16,5" fill="#38bdf8" />
								<text x="-30" y="-8" fill="#38bdf8" font-family="monospace" font-size="11" font-weight="bold">100 nm</text>
							</g>
						</svg>
					</div>

